  "headings": [],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "What it does",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Your MDM sets up the phone. Deploy App gives it an identity: a certificate in its callsign.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5ce3d105e10b06f3.webp",
              "width": 1800,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Why use it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>A whole batch of phones arrives ready, with apps, certificate and the <strong>Deploy App</strong> icon. Nobody types an invite code.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/bb05fb6c668edb7f.webp",
              "width": 1800,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "One callsign per phone",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Each phone joins as its callsign, such as <code>OTTER4</code>, and reaches Deploy App and its services like any user.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/60a22ad1b2c3c1d4.webp",
              "width": 1800,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Enrol first, name after",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Phones enrol in any number and any order. Name them when you like, all at once: each then gets its certificate.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a5345a669422be50.webp",
              "width": 1800,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "You decide when",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Deploy App issues certificates only while you keep enrolment open, at most 2 hours. Every opening makes a new challenge.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5857b63e858095f3.webp",
              "width": 1800,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Who does what",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The Deploy App admin opens enrolment. The MDM operator enrols and names the phones in Fleet.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f88173ae0f4145a6.webp",
              "width": 1800,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "What you need",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>FleetDM with Android Enterprise, and one team in it per Deploy App. <code>odmdm-fleet</code> is optional: it saves the clicks.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2cda0fbf57c7dbcb.webp",
              "width": 1800,
              "height": 1000
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
